{'symbol': 'AMCR', 'date': '2021-09-29 08:47:00', 'title': 'CHANGES TO AMCOR PLC BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "ZURICH, SEPT. 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AMCOR PLC (NYSE: AMCR; ASX: AMC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ACHAL AGARWAL HAS BEEN NOMINATED AS A NON-EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR FOR ELECTION AT THE COMPANY'S ANNUAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS ON WEDNESDAY NOVEMBER 10, 2021."}